n and can't send",{"link_type":36,"key":42,"url":43},"ce727177-1cfb-4168-8916-0ed7e5b6be42","texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"heading":45,"subheading":46,"promo_text":46,"textImage":47,"cardTitle":48,"card_subtitle":46,"destinationsCsv":49,"defaultCountryId":57,"monotypeTitle":58},"Postage to Texas from the UK",null,{},"a parcel to Texas from as little as £9.21",{"link_type":50,"key":51,"kind":52,"id":53,"url":54,"name":55,"size":56},"Media","1460b507-c485-4f65-a6a1-1a3cf80c1449","file","ZCwNmBEAACIAAJpg","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdf0da68b-7584-4eca-a656-20f4b8338e1a_destination_countries_030423.csv","destination_countries_030423.csv","5329","217",{"dimensions":59,"alt":62,"copyright":46,"url":63,"id":64,"edit":65},{"width":60,"height":61},88,24,"Send","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$b0b0a913-8201-43ad-bb8c-844e93019266","international_hero_banner",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":73,"primary":75,"id":99,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[74],{},{"CardImage":76,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":86,"CardText":87,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":80,"copyright":46,"url":81,"id":82,"edit":83},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,665,"Parcels being loaded onto a freight airplane","texas.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ1Gd5pbqstJ98EbK_Freight1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C1000%2C665&w=1000&h=665","Z1Gd5pbqstJ98EbK",{"x":66,"y":84,"zoom":67,"background":68},2,"none","Enjoy reliable shipping to Texas for an affordable price",[88,93,96],{"type":89,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":92},"paragraph","One of the largest and most populous states in the USA, Texas is famous for its rich southern culture as well as it’s bustling metropolitan areas. Touching down in one of Texas’ great international airports, a parcel sent with Evri will cross the Atlantic to reach its destination quickly, safely and for an affordable price. ",[],"ltr",{"type":89,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":92},"Texas deals with massive volumes of incoming parcels every day, which is why you need a trusted courier like Evri to ensure that your package is handled with care and processed correctly. ",[],{"type":89,"text":97,"spans":98,"direction":92},"Our service doesn’t end at Texas state lines. With Evri you can send a parcel anywhere in the USA, or north of the border with our Canada courier service.",[],"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":102,"version":31,"items":103,"primary":116,"id":125,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[104,107,110,113],{"Col1Content":105,"Col2Content":106},"Up to 500g","£9.21",{"Col1Content":108,"Col2Content":109},"1kg","£13.22",{"Col1Content":111,"Col2Content":112},"2kg","£18.45",{"Col1Content":114,"Col2Content":115},"5kg+","£28.68",{"SectionTitle":117,"SectionSubtitle":118,"Col1Header":119,"Col2Header":120,"InformationTableButtonUrl":121,"InformationTableButtonText":124,"isTableShort":20},"How much is it to send a parcel to Texas?","Sending a parcel anywhere in the United States, including Texas, will always be affordable. We can ship parcels as heavy as 15kg. Get started with a quote to find out an exact price on your package, or alternatively check out this handy guide on pricing across some of our more popular weight bands:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":122,"url":123},"496583a8-62c6-4a35-93c0-7778617ef172","texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Texas","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":129,"primary":213,"id":216,"slice_type":217,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[130,152,165,177,189,201],{"title":131,"content":132,"icon":145},"Regular tracking updates",[133],{"type":89,"text":134,"spans":135,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and email notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[136,143],{"start":137,"end":138,"type":139,"data":140},55,63,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":141,"target":142},"texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_self",{"start":137,"end":138,"type":144},"strong",{"dimensions":146,"alt":148,"copyright":46,"url":149,"id":150,"edit":151},{"width":147,"height":147},40,"Phone icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":153,"content":154,"icon":158},"Parcel cover",[155],{"type":89,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":159,"alt":160,"copyright":46,"url":161,"id":162,"edit":163},{"width":147,"height":147},"Money icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":164},"#fff",{"title":166,"content":167,"icon":171},"Customs made easier",[168],{"type":89,"text":169,"spans":170,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":172,"alt":173,"copyright":46,"url":174,"id":175,"edit":176},{"width":147,"height":147},"Passport icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":164},{"title":178,"content":179,"icon":183},"Flexible printing options",[180],{"type":89,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":184,"alt":185,"copyright":46,"url":186,"id":187,"edit":188},{"width":147,"height":147},"Printer icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":164},{"title":190,"content":191,"icon":195},"Bulk Send",[192],{"type":89,"text":193,"spans":194,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our Bulk Send tool",[],{"dimensions":196,"alt":197,"copyright":46,"url":198,"id":199,"edit":200},{"width":147,"height":147},"Laptop icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":202,"content":203,"icon":207},"Trusted by top UK brands",[204],{"type":89,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":208,"alt":209,"copyright":46,"url":210,"id":211,"edit":212},{"width":147,"height":147},"Success icon","texas.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":214,"title":215,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to the USA with Evri?","list_block$87389633-8af1-4da5-9f55-ee48a27248cd","list_block",{"variation":219,"version":31,"items":220,"primary":221,"id":240,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[],{"CardImage":222,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":229,"CardText":230,"ButtonText":237,"ButtonUrl":238,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":223,"alt":224,"copyright":46,"url":225,"id":226,"edit":227},{"width":78,"height":79},"A female Evri van driver poses in the driving seat of her blue Evri van.","texas.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBSJbqstJ9-iOp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9780.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zBSJbqstJ9-iOp",{"x":66,"y":228,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,"Shipping to Dallas",[231,234],{"type":89,"text":232,"spans":233,"direction":92},"The Dallas Fort Worth metroplex alone sees over 1,800 flights landing in its behemoth international airport every day. Your parcel could be joining one of those flights, and when you ship with Evri it is sure to be transported and delivered with the utmost safety to Dallas and beyond. ",[],{"type":89,"text":235,"spans":236,"direction":92},"Drop off at your local ParcelShop or Locker or schedule a Courier  collection to get your parcel on the move. With end-to-end tracking you can follow along your parcels journey. ",[],"Send a parcel to Dallas",{"link_type":36,"key":239,"url":123},"b2de5dbf-437a-4b38-9823-256dcb26a431","card$1289536b-08ef-4bd3-892d-718d89e2341f",{"variation":242,"version":31,"items":243,"primary":245,"id":332,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[244],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":246,"CardText":247,"ButtonText":329,"ButtonUrl":330,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in the USA",[248,251,257,262,266,271,276,280,285,290,295,299,304,308,313,317,322,326],{"type":89,"text":249,"spans":250,"direction":92},"While our international Courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":252,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":92},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[255],{"start":66,"end":256,"type":144},14,{"type":252,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":92},"Martin Luther King Jr Day – 19\u002F01\u002F2026",[260],{"start":66,"end":261,"type":144},26,{"type":252,"text":263,"spans":264,"direction":92},"Confederate Heroes' Day - 19\u002F01\u002F2026",[265],{"start":66,"end":61,"type":144},{"type":252,"text":267,"spans":268,"direction":92},"Presidents’ Day – 16\u002F02\u002F2026",[269],{"start":66,"end":270,"type":144},15,{"type":252,"text":272,"spans":273,"direction":92},"Texas Independence Day - 02\u002F03\u002F2026",[274],{"start":66,"end":275,"type":144},22,{"type":252,"text":277,"spans":278,"direction":92},"San Jacinto Day - 21\u002F04\u002F2026",[279],{"start":66,"end":270,"type":144},{"type":252,"text":281,"spans":282,"direction":92},"Memorial Day – 25\u002F05\u002F2026",[283],{"start":66,"end":284,"type":144},11,{"type":252,"text":286,"spans":287,"direction":92},"Juneteenth – 19\u002F06\u002F2026",[288],{"start":66,"end":289,"type":144},10,{"type":252,"text":291,"spans":292,"direction":92},"Emancipation Day - 19\u002F06\u002F2026",[293],{"start":66,"end":294,"type":144},16,{"type":252,"text":296,"spans":297,"direction":92},"Independence Day – 04\u002F07\u002F2026",[298],{"start":66,"end":294,"type":144},{"type":252,"text":300,"spans":301,"direction":92},"Lyndon Baines Johnson Day - 27\u002F08\u002F2026",[302],{"start":66,"end":303,"type":144},25,{"type":252,"text":305,"spans":306,"direction":92},"Labour Day – 07\u002F09\u002F2026",[307],{"start":66,"end":284,"type":144},{"type":252,"text":309,"spans":310,"direction":92},"Indigenous Peoples’ Day\u002FColumbus Day – 12\u002F10\u002F2026",[311],{"start":66,"end":312,"type":144},36,{"type":252,"text":314,"spans":315,"direction":92},"Veterans’ Day – 11\u002F11\u002F2026",[316],{"start":66,"end":256,"type":144},{"type":252,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":92},"Thanksgiving – 26\u002F11\u002F2026",[320],{"start":66,"end":321,"type":144},12,{"type":252,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":92},"Christmas – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[325],{"start":66,"end":284,"type":144},{"type":89,"text":327,"spans":328,"direction":92},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],"Start the process of sending a parcel to the USA now",{"link_type":36,"key":331,"url":123},"e1d76025-0284-4e85-a567-9ea4cb11065e","card$d590c818-c9ce-4fd6-a97b-18212c99f2cf",{"variation":334,"version":31,"items":335,"primary":399,"id":409,"slice_type":410,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[336,358,379],{"Title":337,"Description":342,"Image":346,"Label":46,"UrlText":352,"Url":353,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":356,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[338],{"type":339,"text":340,"spans":341},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[343],{"type":89,"text":344,"spans":345,"direction":92},"Book your delivery online or in selected Post Offices and drop off your package at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. Don’t have a way to print at home? Get your postage label using our Print in ParcelShop device for free. We’ll take care of everything from there.",[],{"dimensions":347,"alt":348,"copyright":46,"url":349,"id":350,"edit":351},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","texas.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw",{"x":66,"y":228,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":36,"key":354,"url":355},"508e843d-564e-45bf-a7a9-abfceecad27c","texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":357},"Any",{"Title":359,"Description":363,"Image":367,"Label":46,"UrlText":374,"Url":375,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":378,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[360],{"type":339,"text":361,"spans":362},"Lockers",[],[364],{"type":89,"text":365,"spans":366,"direction":92},"We have 24\u002F7 Lockers available in convenient locations across the UK for a quick delivery. Head to your nearest Locker, scan your barcode and place into a secure Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":368,"alt":369,"copyright":46,"url":370,"id":371,"edit":372},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","texas.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":373,"zoom":67,"background":68},17,"Find your nearest Locker",{"link_type":36,"key":376,"url":377},"a606da8b-e263-4052-99e4-67d422b40ca7","texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":357},{"Title":380,"Description":384,"Image":388,"Label":46,"UrlText":394,"Url":395,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":398,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[381],{"type":339,"text":382,"spans":383},"Couriers",[],[385],{"type":89,"text":386,"spans":387,"direction":92},"Even for international delivery we offer door to door courier service, so you don’t even need to leave your home or office to send a parcel to the Texas. Simply follow the link below to send a parcel and select Courier Collection when you make your booking. We’ll give you a one-hour window to pick up the parcel.",[],{"dimensions":389,"alt":390,"copyright":46,"url":391,"id":392,"edit":393},{"width":78,"height":79},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","texas.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10228.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=26%2C0%2C7672%2C5102&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqj5bqstJ9-cLw",{"x":261,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Schedule a Courier collection",{"link_type":36,"key":396,"url":397},"a8802cce-fde7-4eca-91c4-1ebb7d0674d3","texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":357},{"SectionTitle":400,"SectionDescription":405,"theme":46},[401],{"type":402,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":92},"heading2","How to send parcels to Texas",[],[406],{"type":89,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":92},"Choose from three cheap and simple ways to send your packages to Texas from the UK:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":242,"version":31,"items":412,"primary":414,"id":443,"slice_type":100,"slice_label":46},[413],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":415,"CardText":416,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":442,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Texas",[417,426],{"type":89,"text":418,"spans":419,"direction":92},"While you can send lots of items to the Texas with Evri, there are a few limitations. Check our comprehensive breakdown of what you can and can’t send internationally for the latest information. ",[420,425],{"start":421,"end":422,"type":139,"data":423},123,150,{"link_type":36,"url":424,"target":142},"\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":421,"end":422,"type":144},{"type":89,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":92},"You should also follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels to the USA via airlines.",[429,435,436,441],{"start":430,"end":431,"type":139,"data":432},27,59,{"link_type":36,"url":433,"target":434},"texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F","_blank",{"start":430,"end":431,"type":144},{"start":437,"end":438,"type":139,"data":439},68,95,{"link_type":36,"url":440,"target":434},"texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":437,"end":438,"type":144},{"link_type":357},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":219,"version":31,"items":445,"primary":485,"id":487,"slice_type":488,"slice_label":46},[446,455,473],{"questionTitle":447,"questionBody":448},"Can I send a parcel to Texas during the holidays?",[449,452],{"type":89,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":92},"While we always aim to get your parcel delivered as quickly as possible, there are a number of public holidays in the United States that are known to potentially slow down delivery times.",[],{"type":89,"text":453,"spans":454,"direction":92},"To avoid delays on holidays such as Christmas, Thanksgiving and Independence Day, you should plan ahead of time to ensure that your parcel is scheduled to arrive before the festivities begin.",[],{"questionTitle":456,"questionBody":457},"Will my parcel have to go through customs when it reaches Texas?",[458,461,464],{"type":89,"text":459,"spans":460,"direction":92},"All goods whether sold or gifted will have to pass through customs to be permitted entry to the United States. While traditionally you would print and fill out a form to attach to your parcel, at Evri, we take care of that whole process for you. ",[],{"type":89,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":92},"Simply follow the instructions when booking your parcel and your parcel should be processed through customs correctly. ",[],{"type":89,"text":465,"spans":466,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[467,472],{"start":468,"end":469,"type":139,"data":470},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":471,"target":434},"texas.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":468,"end":469,"type":144},{"questionTitle":474,"questionBody":475},"Will I have to pay any tax or duties when I send a parcel to Texas?",[476,479,482],{"type":89,"text":477,"spans":478,"direction":92},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":89,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":92},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":89,"text":483,"spans":484,"direction":92},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"title":486},"Frequently Asked Questions","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,101,127,218,241,333,411,444],["Reactive",491],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":492,"$sclients":559,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":562},{"abtasty":493,"accessibe":497,"appPromoBanner":500,"autoDivertUpdates":503,"awin":506,"bulkInternational":509,"bulkSendEnabled":512,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":515,"enableBasketCount":518,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":521,"euCustomsDuty":524,"groovyAdvert":527,"newInternationalSendFlow":530,"newinternationalpages":537,"oohPreferenceFlag":541,"opentel":544,"premium":547,"savedCards":550,"smallParcelSize":553,"yourPricesDrawer":556},{"_createdAt":494,"_updatedAt":495,"enabled":496},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":498,"_updatedAt":499,"enabled":496},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":501,"_updatedAt":502,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":504,"_updatedAt":505,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":507,"_updatedAt":508,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":510,"_updatedAt":511,"enabled":496},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":513,"_updatedAt":514,"enabled":496},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":516,"_updatedAt":517,"enabled":496},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":519,"_updatedAt":520,"enabled":496},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":522,"_updatedAt":523,"enabled":496},"2025-11-07T14:21:27.204Z","2026-05-14T12:54:05.701Z",{"_createdAt":525,"_updatedAt":526,"enabled":496},"2026-06-18T11:40:48.164Z","2026-06-30T22:04:35.623Z",{"_createdAt":528,"_updatedAt":529,"enabled":496},"2025-10-01T11:40:5